# Volleyball Manager domain

- Follow `system-prompt.md` and `docs/repo-plan.md`. First slice is `docs/first-slice.md` only.
- Every file, function, and interface gets an explanatory comment.
- Isolate features as NestJS modules. Do not import another module’s internals.
- Team / Game / Stat reads default to the active `Season`. Historical reads need an explicit flag + `seasonId`.
- Record stats as inserted `Stat` event rows (type + timestamp). Never `count = count + 1`.
- `isDuesPaid` and `role` change only through ADMIN-only endpoints.
- Store `scheduledAt` in UTC.
- Volunteer registration: transaction + lock; HTTP 409 when full.
- Validate at HTTP and WebSocket boundaries. Parameterize all Prisma queries.
